      → 3DGS (3D Gaussian Splatting) for real-world scans · SDF-regularised via 2025 SDF-from-Gaussians
      → Hypergraph + GA-typed + HVM2 macro-layer (Wolfram-Gorard rewriting)
      → Cubical Agda / CSSLv3-types for macro-layer invariants (univalence at pipeline-time)

