      → CGA L0 lines : 32 floats · one per lane on RDNA3 (borderline)
      → tensor-core acceleration for PGA geometric product in BF16 with FP32 accumulation (P2.W3 cooperative-matrix)
      → Morton codes + NanoVDB + octrees for spatial indexing (P1.W3 Hi-Z + P2.W4 cascaded shadows)

