§I PRIOR-ART
  ⟦
    PA.01 · DOOM 2016 · Forward+ rasterizer 16×16 light-tile · canonical AAA reference · we adopt the tile-cull pattern
              what-we-take : tile-size + threads-per-tile + per-tile-cursor offsets ; what-we-diverge : effect-typed
              fn-sigs · Cap<Gpu> default-deny · spec/32 substrate-effect-pass opt-in layered on top

    PA.02 · Battlefield V · DICE Frostbite 16×16 Forward+ + cluster-shading variant · per ASSERT.P1.02 alignment
              what-we-take : 16×16 canonical proven at 1440p144 ; what-we-diverge : pure-CSSL · sovereign FFI

    PA.03 · Cyberpunk 2077 · CDPR REDengine 4 Forward+ with VRS-Tier-2 + bindless · per spec/56 D-024 ref
              what-we-take : VRS-T2 enables 30-50% perf-multi on low-detail tiles ; what-we-diverge : opt-in not default-on

    PA.04 · Nanite (UE5) · meshlet pipeline · cluster-based geometry · per P2.W9 mesh-shader path
              what-we-take : meshlet amortization for 1M+ triangles/frame ; what-we-diverge : pure-CSSL @gpu fn ·
              D3D12 SM6.5 + VK_EXT_mesh_shader · no UE5 source dep

    PA.05 · Bevy (Rust ECS · wgpu) · per spec/56 comparison · 5+yr ecosystem
              what-we-take : sparse-set ECS pattern (item-52) · structural lessons ; what-we-diverge : effects-first-class ·
              CSL-symbiosis · ¬ LLVM · ¬ wgpu runtime dep (own host backends)

    PA.06 · Mitsuba 3 (research renderer · path-tracer · differentiable) · per P3.W3 + spec/05 autodiff alignment
              what-we-take : Jet<T,N> AD-tape pattern (cssl-jets · spec/17) ; what-we-diverge : real-time-renderer
              not offline · GPU-resident · structural integration via spec/04 effect-rows

    PA.07 · Manuka (Weta Digital) · hero-wavelength spectral path-tracer · per spec/32 V.2 alignment
              what-we-take : hero-wavelength + 4-accomp-N MIS pattern preserves PDF ; what-we-diverge : 16-band
              hyperspectral throughout (NEVER RGB until tonemap) · grep-gate enforces

    PA.08 · D3D12 Work Graphs (Microsoft · 2024 · SM6.8 · all 4 vendors signed-on) · per P4.W1
              what-we-take : @workgraph_node attribute compiles to record-based input/output nodes ;
              what-we-diverge : structural CSSL attribute · cross-emitted to VK_AMDX_shader_enqueue equivalent

    PA.09 · LoA v14 (Odin + wgpu + WGSL) · per LoA-V14-LESSONS-INTEGRATION § above
              full bytecode-VM 80-op spec + procgen-IS-renderer + AABB-pre-cull validated at 144FPS@1440p Arc-A770
              we adopt the bytecode-VM as P3.W6 opt-in · 16×16 light-tile-cull aligns with engine/render_forward · pure-CSSL not Odin

    PA.10 · 1LoA compass-artifact (1360-line math-substrate research) · per 1LOA-MATH-SUBSTRATE-INTEGRATION § above
              PGA G(3,0,1) Motor + CGA + SDF + MLS-MPM tractability-tagged for solo-dev velocity
              we adopt PGA as Phase-B+ language-level (item-65) · MLS-MPM as P2/P4 compute primitive · SDF-from-Gaussians stretch

    PA.11 · CUDA Graphs · NVIDIA · 2018+ · captured-graph-of-operations as single launch · per UPG_02 § persistent-kernels
              we adopt structurally via @persistent_kernel attribute (item-31) · cross-emitted SPIR-V + DXIL

    PA.12 · Halide · Ragan-Kelley · schedule-decoupled-from-algorithm · per spec/65 PA.01
              what-we-take : compile-time GPU/CPU domain-distinction · spec/65 elevates to type-property
              what-we-diverge : memory-domain as type not as schedule
