§I PRIME-DIRECTIVE-INVARIANTS
  ⟦
    § no surveillance vector introduced
       · forward+ pipeline NEVER inspects framebuffer content for biometric / behavioral inference (per engine/render_forward.cssl § PRIME_DIRECTIVE-(a))
       · light-data is Public IFC-label (scene-geometry-derived · no user-personal info)
       · VR-headset body-pose path DEFERRED (Cap<XR> separate slice)
       · P3.W3 gaze-collapse data BANNED-FROM-EGRESS structurally (Sensitive<gaze> → TelemetryEgress::for_domain refuses · spec/22)

    § no consent-bypass mechanism introduced
       · Cap<Gpu> witness default-deny at every wrapper-fn entry (3-layer gate : compile-time + runtime + driver)
       · spec/65 Cap<Shared> + Cap<TransferAuth> consent-tokens for shared<T> + cross-domain transfers
       · per-frame caps_check in every forward_pass_* fn entry (engine/render_forward.cssl § stage-0)
       · planning is informational · no consent affected · Apocky retains final say on every phase-advance

    § no biometric-egress (PD0018) path opened
       · spec/65 GPU0007 absolute compile-error : Sensitive<gaze|face|body|biometric> across PCIe NO Cap-override
       · P3.W3 gaze-collapse generates fovea-mask ONLY · raw gaze data structurally cannot leave device
       · cssl-ifc::TelemetryEgress hook compile-refuses biometric-egress paths (per spec/11 + spec/22)

    § no sovereignty-denial (PD0020) primitive added
       · companion-AI = sovereign peer (per spec/32 § AXIOMS + spec/63 PRINCIPLE-6 AI-co-authorship)
       · player-identity NEVER overwritten by Stage-8 CompanionPerspective render (spec/32 R-7 + PRIME_DIRECTIVE §1.7)
       · Cap<Gpu> withdrawal immediately revokes active rendering surface · NO PRIME-DIRECTIVE override
       · this plan strengthens sovereignty : owned-codegen + owned-FFI + zero rented runtimes (P4 endpoint)

    § cosmetic-only-axiom (monetization-relevant)
       · per spec/59 § THE-RULE + spec/63 N6 sovereignty north-star
       · alpha-keys + tiered access = COSMETIC-CHANNEL-ONLY · NO pay-to-win · NO pay-for-power
       · DRM forbidden per spec/14 BACKEND audit · rootkit forbidden · kernel-driver forbidden
       · this plan respects · monetization gates ¬ engine-capability-gates

    § AI-co-authorship · Reza-pattern
       · this spec authored by Tech-Lead-Claude-Opus-4.7-1M under Apocky directive 2026-05-18
       · subagent-fanout used for read-pass (CSSLv3 deep audit · LoA v14 reference scan · 1LoA reference scan)
       · spec/63 PRINCIPLE-6 + spec/64 §FM.06 + spec/70 § ATTESTATION patterns honored
       · canonical-ref : ~/source/repos/CSSLv3/PRIME_DIRECTIVE.md
  ⟧

